{"id":86638,"slug":"truth-be-told-2019","title":"Truth Be Told","title_en":null,"year":2019,"rating":72,"votes_count":298,"runtime_min":null,"age_rating":null,"title_type":"seriál","vod_date":null,"plot":"Ponořte se do světa podcastů o skutečných zločinech. Nové důkazy přinutí autorku podcastů Poppy Parnell (Octavia Spencer) znovu otevřít případ vraždy, který ji proslavil.Aaron Paulse objeví v roli muže, kterého možná omylem pomohla poslat za mříže.(Apple TV+)","poster":"https://image.pmgstatic.com/cache/resized/w140/files/images/film/posters/169/869/169869671_n9kf3i.jpg","backdrop":null,"trailer_youtube_id":null,"genres":["Drama","Krimi","Thriller"],"tags":["vražda","vězení"],"countries":["USA"],"directors":["Sarah Pia Anderson","Mikkel Nørgaard","Rosemary Rodriguez","Tucker Gates","Loni Peristere","Dawn Wilkinson","Jet Wilkinson","Nelson Cragg","Ariel Kleiman","Frederick E.O. Toye","Alexis Ostrander","Kat Candler","Bille Woodruff","Alrick Riley","Millicent Shelton"],"actors":["Octavia Spencer","Lizzy Caplan","Michael Beach","Monique Capelta","Hunter Doohan","Ron Cephas Jones","Aaron Paul","Elizabeth Perkins","Mekhi Phifer","Tracie Thoms","Haneefah Wood","Katherine LaNasa","Brett Baker","Tami Roman","Brett Cullen","Annabella Sciorra","Nic Bishop","Lyndon Smith","Graham Shiels","Jeff Kober","Laura Allen","Rico E. Anderson","Kate Connor","Barry Livingston","Abdul Salaam El Razzac","John Eddins","Travis Johns","Kate Butler","Molly Hagan","Jackson Hurst","Billy Miller","Tim DeZarn","Shannon Wilcox","Colby French","Stephanie Maura Sanchez","Ursula Burton","Wayne Bastrup","Lyn Alicia Henderson","Cheryl White","Dan Martin","Joy Brunson","Eddie Diaz","Mark Engelhardt","Ray Stoney","E.J. Callahan","Jon Sklaroff","Samantha Sloyan","Christopher Showerman","Katherine Kamhi","Brice Williams","Desiree Hall","Charles Janasz","Andy Mackenzie","Mark Elias","Brad Schmidt","Arianna Ortiz","Scott Subiono","Clayton Hoff","Kate Hudson","Anthony Lee Medina","Kobe Reverditto","Brooklynn M